title: November 2026 Tor News
---
html_body:


<table class="table content-table devicewidth civi-email-align-center" style="border-width:0px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:771px;width:100%;" cellspacing="0">
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td style="border-width:0px;padding:0px;width:100%;">

                <table class="table content-table civi-email-align-center" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-width:0px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;width:100%;" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" cellspacing="0">
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="gutter" style="border-width:0px;padding:0px;width:15px;" width="15">&nbsp;</td>
                            <td style="border-width:0px;padding:0px;">
                                <a href="https://blog.torproject.org/" rel="nofollow"><span style="display:inline-block;"><img class="image_resized" style="aspect-ratio:250/75;height:auto;max-width:100%;width:250px;" src="https://blog.torproject.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/tor-news-logo-560.png" alt="tor-news-logo" width="250" height="75" border="0"></span></a>
                            </td>
